1. Definitions

"Creator" means Noemi Titarenco.

"Company" means any corporation, limited liability company, partnership, or
other for-profit legal entity, together with all of its Affiliates.

"Affiliate" means any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is
controlled by, or is under common control with another entity. "Control"
means ownership of more than fifty percent (50%) of the voting securities or
other ownership interest, or the power to direct management or policies by
contract or otherwise.

"Gross Revenue" means the aggregate worldwide gross revenue of a Company and
all of its Affiliates, before deduction of costs or expenses, as reported in
its most recently completed fiscal year under generally accepted accounting
principles or another consistently applied accounting standard. If the
Company has not completed a fiscal year, Gross Revenue means its aggregate
worldwide gross revenue during the immediately preceding twelve (12) months.

"Restricted Company" means a Company whose Gross Revenue exceeds ten million
United States dollars (US $10,000,000).

2. Restriction

Notwithstanding any other provision of this License, no rights are granted
to any Restricted Company, or to any person or entity using the Software on
behalf of, for the benefit of, or under the direction or control of a
Restricted Company, unless the Creator has first entered into a separate
formal written agreement expressly authorizing that use.

Any purported license, sublicense, assignment, transfer, or other permission
to a Restricted Company is null and void without such an agreement. A
Company that becomes a Restricted Company after beginning to use the
Software must cease all use of the Software upon becoming a Restricted
Company unless and until it enters into such an agreement with the Creator.

For purposes of this rider, "use" includes, without limitation, copying,
modifying, merging, publishing, distributing, sublicensing, selling,
transferring, making available, hosting, deploying, executing, benchmarking,
testing, analyzing, indexing, or incorporating the Software or any derivative
work of the Software into another product, service, dataset, training corpus,
evaluation harness, or automated system.

3. Derivative Works and Redistribution

This rider applies to the Software and all derivative works of the Software.
Any distribution of the Software or a derivative work must include this
License, including this rider, unmodified. No distributor may grant a
