4. Termination and Enforcement

Any breach of this rider automatically and immediately terminates the
permissions granted by this License to the breaching party. Upon termination,
the breaching party must immediately cease using and distributing the
Software and all derivative works and destroy all copies under its control.

A breach of this rider may cause irreparable harm for which monetary damages
are inadequate. The Creator may seek injunctive or other equitable relief, in
addition to any other remedies available at law. To the maximum extent
permitted by applicable law, the prevailing party in an action to enforce
this rider is entitled to recover reasonable attorneys' fees and costs.

